1. BEFORE — the staging bug (Phase 10 §11.2 item 3)
================================================================================

Before W1, run/sponge-de-test.run and run/sponge-launcher.run copied
the seven Qt6 .lib.so / qt6_*.tar files into [run_dir]/genode/ AFTER
build_boot_image:

  build_boot_image [build_artifacts]   <- packs image.elf on base-sel4
  foreach lib { libQt6Core.lib.so ... qt6_dejavusans.tar } {
      set dst "[run_dir]/genode/$lib"
      if {![file exists $dst]} { exec cp -L "bin/$lib" $dst }
  }

On base-sel4 the Genode run tool's boot_dir/sel4 plugin invokes
`remove_genode_dir` after build_boot_image: every file copied into
[run_dir]/genode/ that was NOT a build_boot_image module is deleted.
The cp loop above therefore staged the Qt6 libs into a directory that
was about to be removed, so they never reached the guest image.elf.
The two scenarios could never PASS on seL4 with that order.

This is exactly the gotcha captured in docs/11-environment.md §10.4
("base-sel4 packs a single image.elf") and §10.4 explicitly notes
"run/sponge-de-test.run's Qt6-lib staging is base-linux-specific".

================================================================================
2. AFTER — the W1 staging fix (this commit)
================================================================================

Both run scripts now stage into bin/ BEFORE build_boot_image and pass
the extras explicitly in the module list (the proven reference pattern
in run/sponge-de-sel4-interactive.run lines 474-629):

  # docs/11-environment.md §10.4: base-sel4 packs image.elf at
  # build_boot_image time; modules added after never reach the guest.
  exec mkdir -p bin
  # ... generate qt6_dejavusans.tar into bin/ ...
  # ... copy default.theme into bin/ ...
  set boot_modules [build_artifacts]
  foreach m { libQt6Core.lib.so ... default.theme \
              [pkg_<name>.xml] pkg_index.xml } {
      lappend boot_modules $m
  }
  build_boot_image $boot_modules

The diff stat (this commit, run/ only):

  run/sponge-de-test.run    | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---------- (34 +, 18 -)
  run/sponge-launcher.run   | 57 +++++++++++++++++++++++------------ (36 +, 21 -)

The launcher scenario additionally moves pkg_hello.xml / pkg_ncurses.xml
/ pkg_nano.xml / pkg_index.xml into bin/ before build_boot_image
(the original copied them to [run_dir]/genode/ as well, with the same
delete-after-build bug).

